job_title: Senior Python Backend Developer - FastAPI
company_repo: fastapi/fastapi
salary_range: $140k-$180k
overview: "FastAPI is seeking a Senior Python Backend Developer to help maintain and evolve one of the fastest-growing Python web frameworks with over 91k stars on GitHub. As a core member of the FastAPI team, you'll work on high-performance async APIs, contribute to the framework's development, and help shape the future of modern Python web development."
overview_reason: "Based on repo analysis showing FastAPI is a high-performance async framework with 91,953 stars, focused on building production-ready APIs with modern Python features."
