responsibilities[6,]{responsibility,reason}:
  "Develop and maintain core FastAPI framework features including routing, dependency injection, and request/response handling",Core framework development is essential for maintaining and improving FastAPI's functionality
  Design and implement high-performance async APIs using modern Python features,FastAPI's core value proposition is built around async performance and modern Python features
  Create and review technical documentation for framework features and APIs,Documentation is crucial for framework adoption and community understanding
  Contribute to architectural decisions and framework design improvements,Senior role requires involvement in high-level technical decisions
  Collaborate with the open source community to review PRs and resolve issues,FastAPI is an open source project requiring active community engagement
  Optimize framework performance and implement security best practices,Performance and security are critical for a production web framework
qualifications[8,]{qualification,importance,reason}:
  7+ years of Python backend development experience,must-have,Senior role requires extensive Python expertise
  Deep understanding of async Python and modern Python type hints,must-have,FastAPI heavily utilizes async programming and type annotations
  Extensive experience with API development and RESTful services,must-have,Core focus of the framework is API development
  "Strong knowledge of HTTP protocols, WebSocket, and API security",must-have,Essential for developing web framework features
  Experience with high-performance web frameworks and ASGI,must-have,FastAPI is built on ASGI and focuses on performance
  Proven track record of contributing to open source projects,must-have,Role involves significant open source work
  Excellent code review and technical documentation skills,must-have,Required for maintaining code quality and documentation
  Expert understanding of API design patterns and best practices,must-have,Necessary for framework architecture decisions
